Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:11.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The player is staying fairly central there — the tape from behind the baseline,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球员站位保持居中\N球擦网带而过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:16.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is match point for Xinran Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是孙心然的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:26.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got two of them, and executes on the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个赛点 第一个就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:29.05,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}21{\fs68}号下午 成都
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.67,TL,,0,0,0,,世界网联青年组年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:32.95,TL,,0,0,0,,女子{\fs78}A{\fs68}组第一轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:34.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:37.24,TL,,0,0,0,,迎战塞尔维亚的茨维特科维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:01:09.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cvetkovic firing her shot long, slapping the ball away in frustration.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N茨维特科维奇击球出界\N懊恼地拍了一下球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.70,TL,,0,0,0,,第一局 孙心然在{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.67,TL,,0,0,0,,时连救{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点 保发拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:21.21,TL,,0,0,0,,但第三局 第五局 她两度被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:23.02,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.02,0:01:26.34,TL,,0,0,0,,她的右膝接受了理疗师的治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:43.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two break points for Xinran Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然拿到两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:49.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cvetkovic had to wait a long time to begin this game — just getting under her skin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局前等了太久\N她的心态受了影响
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:02.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Disappointing to let that chance go — but she still has a break point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N错失良机有些可惜\N但她还有一个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:24.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And we'll see it through — here's Cvetkovic, wide down the line,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N茨维特科维奇直线回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:37.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she will serve two games to four down. Now, the apology comes from the Serbian.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二比四 她的发球局\N举手致歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:39.08,TL,,0,0,0,,第六局 破发点上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.93,TL,,0,0,0,,茨维特科维奇一记直线回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.93,0:02:43.40,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然立刻回破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:45.33,TL,,0,0,0,,把比分追到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第九局顶住压力保发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.33,TL,,0,0,0,,第十局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:51.47,TL,,0,0,0,,轮到茨维特科维奇为这一盘发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:03:05.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun has grown stronger and stronger in this first set since the visit of the physio.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N暂停过后\N孙心然越打越强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:14.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Something was clearly not right in those opening games, when she was broken twice.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局连丢两个发球局时\N她的状态明显不对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:16.82,TL,,0,0,0,,这一局 孙心然连拿三分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:18.33,TL,,0,0,0,,逼出破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:21.48,TL,,0,0,0,,第一个被救掉 第二个 她兑现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:23.39,TL,,0,0,0,,对手的发球胜盘局被破
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:26.48,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 比赛回到同一起跑线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:37.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Both service points from Cvetkovic in this tiebreak go the way of her opponent.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N抢七她的两个发球分\N又都送给了对手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:47.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You can see her way to victory in this first set now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她离拿下首盘不远了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:52.80,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 剧本重演
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:55.17,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然又是{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}开局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.81,TL,,0,0,0,,但这一次 第三局她立刻回破
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:03:59.75,TL,,0,0,0,,没有给对手机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:11.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And there it is — Cvetkovic wide on the ad side.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N茨维特科维奇占先区回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:21.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun leading three games to two, serving next — and already a set up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然三比二领先\N接下来她的发球局\N已先下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:24.53,TL,,0,0,0,,第五局 破发点上 两人底线相持
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:27.57,TL,,0,0,0,,茨维特科维奇占先区一侧回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:30.18,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然破发反超 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:32.67,TL,,0,0,0,,第七局再破 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:36.39,TL,,0,0,0,,这一盘 对手{\fs78}4{\fs68}个发球局 丢了{\fs78}3{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:49.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The player is staying fairly central there — the tape from behind the baseline,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N球员站位保持居中\N球擦网带而过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:54.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is match point for Xinran Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是孙心然的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:05:04.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's got two of them, and executes on the first.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个赛点 第一个就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:12.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set and match to Xinran Sun, 7-6, 6-2,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束\N孙心然七比六 六比二获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:17.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and the result she might have scarcely believed{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个结果连她自己都难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:26.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in herself, when she was receiving treatment to her right knee from the physio,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘一比三落后时\N她的右膝接受了理疗师治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:36.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}three games to one down in the opening set — from there, she roared back,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从那时起她强势反弹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:43.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and found herself two games down at the start of the second set as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘开局又零比二落后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:49.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It looked like Cvetkovic might mount a comeback — but that was as far as it went.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手看似要起势\N但也就到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:56.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sun would once again rally, winning six consecutive games to take her opening match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然再度反弹\N连赢六局拿下首胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.16,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:00.71,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然拿下小组赛开门红
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.08,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后都能翻回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:05.73,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七一个发球分都不给对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:07.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁 青年世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:10.13,TL,,0,0,0,,主场首秀的第一份答卷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:12.48,TL,,0,0,0,,小组赛还有两场 你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:15.12,TL,,0,0,0,,她在成都 能走多远？
